0 FILE main.ldr
0 Transparent Window Test
0 Name: main.ldr
0 Author: BrickThrift synthetic fixtures
0 // Two identical sealed boxes side by side.
0 //   Box A (at x 0)    - the +X wall is Trans-Clear (LDraw colour 47).
0 //   Box B (at x -200) - fully opaque.
0 // Both contain an identical red 2x4 brick.
0 // EXPECTED: box A's brick is NOT recoloured, because a transparent part does
0 // not hide what is behind it. Box B's brick IS recoloured. Getting one and
0 // not the other is the whole point of this fixture.

1 16 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 glass-box.ldr
1 4 0 -24 0 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 3001.dat
0 STEP

1 16 -200 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 solid-box.ldr
1 4 -200 -24 0 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 3001.dat
0 STEP

